{
  "id": "IgReelTranscripts01",
  "name": "Transcribe a creator's Instagram Reels into text with 3-second hooks using Apify",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Transcribe a creator's Instagram Reels into text with hooks\n\n**Setup (3 minutes)**\n1. Open **Config** and paste your Apify API token (console.apify.com → Settings → Integrations).\n2. Set `instagramHandle` (`nasa`, `@nasa` or a profile URL) and `maxReels`.\n3. Click **Test workflow**.\n\n**What you get:** one row per reel with the spoken transcript, the first-3-seconds hook, language, duration, plays and likes. Reels with no speech are not charged unless you set `includeOnScreenText` to true.\n\n**Cost:** steadyfetch/instagram-reel-transcript-scraper, from $5 per 1,000 reels on Apify's Business plan ($15 on the free plan). A 10-reel test run is about $0.15. Apify's free credit covers it.\n\nWire Google Sheets, Airtable or Slack after the last node.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "9b2e0001-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Read me first",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "9b2e0001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "When clicking 'Test workflow'",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-token",
              "name": "apifyToken",
              "value": "PASTE_YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-handle",
              "name": "instagramHandle",
              "value": "nasa",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-max",
              "name": "maxReels",
              "value": 10,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-ocr",
              "name": "includeOnScreenText",
              "value": false,
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9b2e0001-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/steadyfetch~instagram-reel-transcript-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items?token={{ $('Config').first().json.apifyToken }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ handles: [ String($('Config').first().json.instagramHandle) ], maxReelsPerHandle: $('Config').first().json.maxReels, includeOnScreenText: $('Config').first().json.includeOnScreenText === true }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "9b2e0001-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Transcribe the creator's reels",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "f-status",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-creator",
              "name": "creator",
              "value": "={{ $json.ownerUsername }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-url",
              "name": "reel_url",
              "value": "={{ $json.postUrl }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-hook",
              "name": "hook_first_3s",
              "value": "={{ $json.hook3s }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-text",
              "name": "transcript",
              "value": "={{ $json.transcript }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-ocr",
              "name": "on_screen_text",
              "value": "={{ $json.onScreenText }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-lang",
              "name": "language",
              "value": "={{ $json.language }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-sec",
              "name": "seconds",
              "value": "={{ $json.durationSeconds }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-caption",
              "name": "caption",
              "value": "={{ $json.caption }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-charged",
              "name": "charged",
              "value": "={{ $json.charged }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9b2e0001-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Tidy fields (pipe to Sheets from here)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When clicking 'Test workflow'": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Config",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Config": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Transcribe the creator's reels",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Transcribe the creator's reels": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Tidy fields (pipe to Sheets from here)",
